  "limitations": [
    "Manually reviewed body ownership is not automatic person-instance segmentation or learned AI.",
    "Only same-person effective-source-stage face reference; no arbitrary donor, brightest-person choice, final edited-face equivalence or brightness matching.",
    "Requires actual visible shoulders/hips, adequate own-face/body samples and guided context; unsupported scale or occlusion refuses.",
    "Natural pigmentation, coloured light, makeup, tattoos and unknown occlusion remain ambiguous; median is not physical illumination truth.",
    "No masks, reference samples, FaceRef/BodyRef ownership or consent transfer. Every active target needs its own fresh operation-specific evidence. Generic derived preset installation remains guarded.",
    "Independent later colour operations can change final relation. Current-stage Y preservation is not whole-pipeline invariance.",
    "Opaque SDR only; broader alpha/HDR remains refused rather than clipped. No dedicated recovery brush.",
    "Optional new native symbol must be installed; old ABI1 alone does not grant capability. No runtime build or fallback.",
    "All authored fixtures and compiler/build/typecheck/native/UI/inference/photo/export-parity/performance acceptance remain UNRUN."
  ],
